id: blueprint-survivor
name: Genetic Survivor
order: 1
optionOf: combat-blueprint
optionEffect: 2
# Artificial Warrior's Option chosen: this one.
follows: genetic-survivor
description: >
  If you spend 2+ Adaptation Points through the 3rd effect of Artificial Warrior, you may reduce the Damage Category of that Attacking Maneuver by 1 Category for the sake of your Damage Calculation.
text: >
  Genetic Survivor [Triggered, 1/Round]: If you spend 2+ Adaptation Points through the 3rd effect of Artificial Warrior, you may reduce the Damage Category of that Attacking Maneuver by 1 Category for the sake of your Damage Calculation.

---

# Asked as the hit is settled, with 2+ Adaptation Points spent on it - its Damage Category 1 lower, once a Round (chat.mjs
# adaptationReductionFor).
[passive]
allow blueprint.survivor;
